            <fr:title text="Internal Finiteness">Internal Finiteness</fr:title>
          </fr:frontmatter>
          <fr:mainmatter>
            <fr:p>Define a grammar <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex> to be <fr:em>finite</fr:em> (or perhaps <fr:em>subfinite</fr:em>) if it is a subobject of grammar of finite cardinals.

<fr:tex display="block"><![CDATA[A \hookrightarrow  \mathsf {Fin}]]></fr:tex>

Where <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathsf {Fin}]]></fr:tex> is defined as follows.</fr:p>
            <fr:tree show-metadata="false">
              <fr:frontmatter>
                <fr:authors>
                  <fr:author>
                    <fr:link href="stevenschaefer.xml" title="Steven Schaefer" addr="stevenschaefer" type="local">Steven Schaefer</fr:link>
                  </fr:author>
                </fr:authors>
                <fr:date>
                  <fr:year>2025</fr:year>
